<speak>Hello, Adeline. Yes, I am in the small meeting room, not at my usual desk. I told the office to leave me alone for a while unless something really needs my attention. Let me give you the particulars first. My identification number is <sub alias="tee">T</sub> two zero one eight nine nine seven <sub alias="why">Y</sub>. My date of birth is the nineteenth of March nineteen sixty. The reception here can be a little patchy near the warehouse, but in this room it should be all right. I have a notebook with me as well. Usually I try to remember everything, then by the evening I cannot remember which conversation belonged to the bank and which belonged to the business.</speak>